cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts in your research, please cite this software archive as below."
title: "R scripts for statistical downscaling of CCSM3 (TraCE-21ka) paleoclimate simulations for Europe"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jdivisek/DownscalingCCSM3"
authors:
  - family-names: "<Divíšek>"
    given-names: "<Jan>"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5127-5130"
abstract: >-
  R workflow using SAGA GIS (via RSAGA) for statistical downscaling of transient CCSM3
  (TraCE-21ka) paleoclimate simulations (21,000 BP to present in 100-year time windows)
  to high spatial resolution (30 arc-seconds) using CHELSA reference climatology, and 
  computation of 19 BIOCLIM and 16 ENVIREM variables for Europe.
keywords:
  - paleoclimate
  - statistical downscaling
  - TraCE-21ka
  - CCSM3
  - CHELSA
  - BIOCLIM
  - ENVIREM
  - SAGA GIS
  - R